# {{VAULT_NAME}}

Personal vault for {{NAME}}. Generated by `vault-init` on {{DATE}}.

Open this folder in Obsidian to use the dashboard, wikilinks, and graph view.

For the AI layer: `cd` to this folder and start Claude Code. Your CoS persona is at `CLAUDE.md`.

## Three rules

1. Nothing enters the vault unprocessed. `Inbox/` is a queue.
2. `Notes/` is your thinking only. AI never writes there.
3. Every file has a goal or a goal-owner. No orphans.

## Structure

```
CLAUDE.md       — CoS persona
handoff.md      — role transitions
journal.md      — daily log, latest on top
todo.md         — task tracker
today.md        — written by morning-briefing cron
onboarding.md   — open setup items, surfaced by CoS until done
Notes/          — your original thinking (human-only)
Inbox/          — landing zone (classify, don't dump)
Projects/       — active work, each with goal
Life/Context/   — stable facts about you
```
